# The raw camera originals stay here as local masters but are never committed
# or deployed. Every byte the site actually serves comes from the web
# derivatives listed below, encoded with:
#
#   ffmpeg -y -ss <offset> -i "<master>.mp4" -t <seconds> \
#     -c:v libx264 -crf 27 -preset veryslow -profile:v main -level 3.1 \
#     -pix_fmt yuv420p -movflags +faststart -an -metadata:s:v rotate=0 \
#     "<name>.mp4"
#
# and posters via -frames:v 1 -q:v 6. These four are the landscape clips used
# in the hero background slideshow (components/hero-slideshow.tsx); the
# portrait cutting clip is not part of this branch.
*

!.gitignore
!hero-corrugation.mp4
!hero-corrugation.jpg
!coil-feed.mp4
!coil-feed.jpg
!sheet-inspection.mp4
!sheet-inspection.jpg
!coil-stock-loop.mp4
!coil-stock-loop.jpg
